{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "kind": "help-article",
  "title": "Onboarding an Amazon Web Services Account",
  "source": {
    "url": "https://help.zscaler.com/zpc/onboarding-amazon-web-services-account",
    "node": "1394156",
    "revision": "2561946",
    "updated": "2026-01-06",
    "updated_basis": "pdf-last-modified"
  },
  "captured_at": "2026-11-04",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "text": "Zscaler Posture Control (ZPC) supports onboarding an AWS organization or a single AWS cloud account. When onboarded, ZPC provides insight into your account's security posture. ZPC provides two automation bash scripts, initial script and onboarding script, that you can run on your AWS Cloud Shell to onboard your AWS cloud accounts."
    },
    {
      "item": "Initial Script",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "The initial script:",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Creates a Role with name ZPC-ORG-${TENANT_HASH}.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Grants the created role arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/AWSOrganizationsReadOnlyAccess policy via sts:AssumeRole depending on a sts:ExternalId.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "Onboarding Script",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "The onboarding script:",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Verifies if the script was run by the root user of the AWS management account or not.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Assigns the following policies to the helper user:",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/AdministratorAccess",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/AWSOrganizationsFullAccess",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "Creates the following:",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 3
    },
    {
      "item": "A CloudFormation Stack with name ZPC-ORG-${TENANT_HASH}.",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "A CloudFormation StackSet with name ZPC-ORG-${TENANT_HASH}.",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "A Helper user with the name zpc-onboarding-helper-${TENANT_HASH}.",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "ZPC creates the CloudFormation Stack and StackSet to create the ZPCCustom role on all selected AWS accounts. The script creates only the ZPCCustom role if you are onboarding a single AWS account.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Assigns the SecurityAudit managed policy to the role.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 4
    },
    {
      "item": "Assigns the following custom policies to the role:",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 5
    },
