    {
      "text": "To onboard an AWS account to ZPC:"
    },
    {
      "item": "1. Ensure all prerequisites are met.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "To onboard an AWS cloud account or an AWS organization to ZPC:",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "You need to have access to the administrative AWS management account.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "You need to be a ZPC administrator. To learn more, see About Administrators.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "2. Onboard an AWS organization.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "To onboard an AWS organization to ZPC:",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to Administration > Cloud Accounts.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          20
        ],
        [
          23,
          37
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
